## How This Works

- `/ingest [source]` adds rows to this table
- `/audit staleness` checks "Still Current?" and flags sources older than 90 days
- Each source links to a detailed summary in `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-ingest-{topic}.md`
- Cross-references to project docs are tracked in each summary page
